 ⏺ [1;4mReading the session layer[0m

   The [1msession layer[0m wraps [3macpx[0m so the interface never touches a process. Start with [34msrc/session/session.ts[39m, then see
   the [4m[34mACP spec[0;2m (https://agentclientprotocol.com)[0m for the wire format.

   [1mWhat it does[0m

   [2m-[0m opens one persistent session per chord session
   [2m-[0m starts turns with [34mstartTurn[39m and cancels them
     [2m1.[0m a cancel stops the turn at once
     [2m2.[0m the agent is told with [34msession/cancel[39m
   [2m-[0m closes the agent and waits until its exit is seen

   [2m│[0m A closed agent counts as gone only once its exit is seen:
   [2m│[0m [2m┌ ts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[0m
   [2m│[0m [2m│[0m [35mawait[39m session.[34mclose[39m(); [90m// resolves once the exit is seen[39m [2m│[0m
   [2m│[0m [2m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[0m

